	'rel-yongsu-chunchu': 'Nine-year-old Chunchu holds up a paper lantern on the first stepping stone while his father Yongsu walks away across the black river',
	'rel-taizong-zhi': 'From the deathbed the Second Emperor grips his kneeling son’s shoulder; the vast yellow imperial robe spills down over Prince Zhi’s back',
	'rel-sunduk-jinduk': 'By one oil lamp, Seungman cradles the back of Queen Sunduk’s head and pins the gold crescent binyeo into her grey hair as the Queen rests against her, eyes closed',
	'rel-sunduk-chunchu': 'Queen Sunduk rests her hand on the bowed head of her kneeling nephew; his hands lie on a map unrolled from her feet toward the north',
	'rel-chunmyung-chunchu': 'At the foot of the stairs to the empty throne, Chunchu sleeps with his head in his mother’s lap; Princess Chunmyung keeps her hand in his hair and her eyes on the dark hall',
